2026-08-15T14:34:59.2522919Z [36;1m    fi[0m
2026-08-15T14:34:59.2523043Z [36;1m[0m
2026-08-15T14:34:59.2523237Z [36;1m    # Split "gcc -std=gnu2x" into the compiler and its flags: only the[0m
